{
  "version": 1,
  "partId": "cam15-t2-p3",
  "audioFile": "cam15-test2-part3.mp3",
  "durationSeconds": 427.690667,
  "method": "whisper-local",
  "cues": [
    {
      "id": "cue-1",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "You will hear two students of English called Kathy and Graham planning a display on 19th",
      "start": 2.08,
      "end": 9.06
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-2",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "century British life and literature for a university event.",
      "start": 9.06,
      "end": 13.86
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-3",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "First, you have some time to look at questions 21 to 24.",
      "start": 13.86,
      "end": 39.24
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-4",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Now listen carefully and answer questions 21 to 24.",
      "start": 39.24,
      "end": 46.66
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-5",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Okay, Graham, so let's check we both know what we're supposed to be doing.",
      "start": 46.66,
      "end": 51.42
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-6",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Okay.",
      "start": 51.42,
      "end": 52.48
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-7",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "So, for the university's open day we have to plan a display on British life and literature in the mid 19th century.",
      "start": 52.48,
      "end": 60.24
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-8",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "That's right, but we'll have some people to help us find the materials and set it up remember.",
      "start": 60.24,
      "end": 66.36
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-9",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "For the moment we just need to plan it.",
      "start": 66.36,
      "end": 68.96
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-10",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Good.",
      "start": 68.96,
      "end": 69.2
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-11",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "So, have you gathered who's expected to come and see the display?",
      "start": 69.2,
      "end": 73.36
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-12",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Is it for the people studying English or students from other departments?",
      "start": 73.36,
      "end": 77.88
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-13",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "I'm not clear about it.",
      "start": 77.88,
      "end": 79.58
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-14",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "No, me.",
      "start": 79.58,
      "end": 80.22
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-15",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "That was how it used to be, but it didn't attract many people.",
      "start": 80.22,
      "end": 84.64
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-16",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "So, this year it's going to be part of an open day to raise the university's profile.",
      "start": 84.64,
      "end": 90.32
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-17",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "It'll be publicised in the city to encourage people to come and find out something of what goes on here.",
      "start": 90.32,
      "end": 97.26
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-18",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "And it's included in the information that's sent to people who are considering applying to study here next year.",
      "start": 97.26,
      "end": 103.86
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-19",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Presumably, some current students and lecturers will come.",
      "start": 103.86,
      "end": 107.04
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-20",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "I would imagine so, but we've been told to concentrate on the other categories of people.",
      "start": 107.04,
      "end": 112.64
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-21",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Right.",
      "start": 112.64,
      "end": 113.78
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-22",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "We don't have to cover the whole range of 19th century literature, do we?",
      "start": 113.78,
      "end": 118.54
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-23",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "No, it's entirely up to us.",
      "start": 118.54,
      "end": 120.62
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-24",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "I suggest just using Charles Dickens.",
      "start": 120.62,
      "end": 123.7
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-25",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "That's a good idea.",
      "start": 123.7,
      "end": 125.5
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-26",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Most people have heard of him and have probably read some of his novels or seen films based on them.",
      "start": 125.5,
      "end": 132.3
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-27",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "So, that's a good lead-in to life in his time.",
      "start": 132.3,
      "end": 134.92
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-28",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Exactly, and his novels show the awful conditions that most people had to live in, don't they?",
      "start": 134.92,
      "end": 141.02
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-29",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "He wanted to shock people into doing something about it.",
      "start": 141.02,
      "end": 144.42
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-30",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Did he do any campaigning, other than writing?",
      "start": 144.42,
      "end": 147.4
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-31",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Yes, he campaigned for education and other social reforms and gave talks.",
      "start": 147.4,
      "end": 153.68
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-32",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "But I'm inclined to ignore that and focus on the novels.",
      "start": 153.68,
      "end": 157.42
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-33",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Yes, I agree.",
      "start": 157.42,
      "end": 161.7
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-34",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Before you hear the rest of the discussion,",
      "start": 161.7,
      "end": 164.42
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-35",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "you have some time to look at questions 25 to 30.",
      "start": 164.42,
      "end": 198.11
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-36",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Now, listen and answer questions 25 to 30.",
      "start": 198.11,
      "end": 205.89
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-37",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Okay, so now should we think about a topic linked to each novel?",
      "start": 205.89,
      "end": 210.85
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-38",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Yes, I've printed out a list of Dickens' novels in the order they were published in the hope you'd agree to focus on him.",
      "start": 210.85,
      "end": 219.11
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-39",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "You're lucky I did agree.",
      "start": 219.11,
      "end": 221.39
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-40",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Let's have a look.",
      "start": 221.39,
      "end": 223.59
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-41",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Okay, the first was the Pickwick papers published in 1836.",
      "start": 223.59,
      "end": 230.25
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-42",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "It was very successful when it came out, wasn't it?",
      "start": 230.25,
      "end": 233.65
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-43",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "And was adapted for the theatre straight away.",
      "start": 233.65,
      "end": 236.23
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-44",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "There's an interesting point though, that there's a character who keeps falling asleep",
      "start": 236.23,
      "end": 241.05
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-45",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "and that medical condition was named after the book, Pickwickian Syndrome.",
      "start": 241.05,
      "end": 246.27
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-46",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Oh, so why don't we use that as the topic",
      "start": 246.27,
      "end": 249.67
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-47",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "and include some quotations from the novel?",
      "start": 249.67,
      "end": 252.35
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-48",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Right.",
      "start": 252.35,
      "end": 253.33
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-49",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Next is Oliver Twist.",
      "start": 253.33,
      "end": 256.17
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-50",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "There's a lot in the novel about poverty, but maybe something less obvious.",
      "start": 256.17,
      "end": 261.19
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-51",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Well, Oliver is taught how to steal, isn't he?",
      "start": 261.19,
      "end": 265.77
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-52",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "We could use that to illustrate the fact that very few children went to school,",
      "start": 265.77,
      "end": 270.87
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-53",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "particularly not poor children, so they learnt in other ways.",
      "start": 270.87,
      "end": 274.11
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-54",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Good idea.",
      "start": 274.11,
      "end": 276.29
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-55",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "What's next?",
      "start": 276.29,
      "end": 277.87
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-56",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Maybe Nicholas Nickelbee.",
      "start": 277.87,
      "end": 280.43
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-57",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Actually, he taught in a really cruel school, didn't he?",
      "start": 280.43,
      "end": 284.09
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-58",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "That's right.",
      "start": 284.09,
      "end": 285.59
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-59",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "But there's also the company of touring actors that Nicholas joins.",
      "start": 285.59,
      "end": 290.39
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-60",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "We could do something on theatres and other amusements of the time.",
      "start": 290.39,
      "end": 295.77
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-61",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "We don't want only the bad things, do we?",
      "start": 295.77,
      "end": 298.83
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-62",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Okay.",
      "start": 298.83,
      "end": 299.93
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-63",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "What about Martin Chuzzlewitt?",
      "start": 299.93,
      "end": 302.13
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-64",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "He goes to the USA, doesn't he?",
      "start": 302.13,
      "end": 304.51
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-65",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Yes, and Dickens himself had been there a year before",
      "start": 304.51,
      "end": 308.07
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-66",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "and drew on his experience there in the novel.",
      "start": 308.07,
      "end": 311.85
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-67",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "I wonder though, the main theme is selfishness.",
      "start": 311.85,
      "end": 316.61
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-68",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "So we could do something on social justice?",
      "start": 316.61,
      "end": 320.35
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-69",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "No, too general.",
      "start": 320.35,
      "end": 322.23
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-70",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Let's keep to your idea.",
      "start": 322.23,
      "end": 324.01
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-71",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "I think it would work well.",
      "start": 324.01,
      "end": 326.05
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-72",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "He wrote Bleak House next.",
      "start": 326.05,
      "end": 328.27
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-73",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "That's my favourite of his novels.",
      "start": 328.27,
      "end": 330.31
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-74",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Yes, mine too.",
      "start": 330.31,
      "end": 330.99
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-75",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "His satire of the legal system is pretty powerful.",
      "start": 330.99,
      "end": 334.81
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-76",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "That's true.",
      "start": 334.81,
      "end": 335.89
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-77",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "But think about Esther, the heroine.",
      "start": 335.89,
      "end": 337.93
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-78",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "As a child, she lives with someone she doesn't know is her aunt,",
      "start": 337.93,
      "end": 342.35
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-79",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "who treats her very badly.",
      "start": 342.35,
      "end": 343.65
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-80",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Then she's very happy living with her guardian,",
      "start": 343.65,
      "end": 346.81
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-81",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "and he puts her in charge of the household.",
      "start": 346.81,
      "end": 349.87
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-82",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "And at the end, she gets married, and her guardian gives her",
      "start": 349.87,
      "end": 353.31
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-83",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "and her husband a house, where, of course, they're very happy.",
      "start": 353.31,
      "end": 356.45
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-84",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Yes, I like that.",
      "start": 356.45,
      "end": 357.97
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-85",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "What should we take next?",
      "start": 357.97,
      "end": 359.67
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-86",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "A little Dorit.",
      "start": 359.67,
      "end": 362.01
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-87",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Old Mr. Dorit has been in a debtor's prison for years.",
      "start": 362.01,
      "end": 365.77
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-88",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "So was Dickens' father, wasn't he?",
      "start": 365.77,
      "end": 368.35
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-89",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "That's right.",
      "start": 368.35,
      "end": 369.87
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-90",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "What about focusing on the part when Mr. Dorit inherits a fortune",
      "start": 369.87,
      "end": 373.95
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-91",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "and he starts pretending he's always been rich?",
      "start": 373.95,
      "end": 376.91
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-92",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Good idea.",
      "start": 376.91,
      "end": 379.63
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-93",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "So next, we need to think about what materials we want",
      "start": 379.63,
      "end": 383.37
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-94",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "to illustrate each issue.",
      "start": 383.37,
      "end": 384.99
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-95",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "That's going to be quite hard.",
      "start": 384.99,
      "end": 389.02
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-96",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "That is the end of part three.",
      "start": 389.02,
      "end": 392.56
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-97",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "You now have 30 seconds to check your answers to part three.",
      "start": 392.56,
      "end": 427.691
    }
  ]
}
